arch/s390x, zxfoundation, drivers, build: NNPA facility API, STSI wrapper, kernel-wide zcomponent refactor

* Architecture API: NNPA (Neural Network Processing Assist) facility interface for z16; typed STSI 15 configuration topology wrapper
* Source refactorization: ~350 files reorganized into zcomponent layout (manifest, interface, core implementation) across arch/s390x, zxfoundation/, lib/, drivers/, crypto/, fs/
* Build: linker scripts OUTPUT_FORMAT/OUTPUT_ARCH fixes; sysroot for s390x-glibc; zxlibstdc++ submodule update

Bug fixes:
    - PAGE_MASK corrected (was offset mask, now alignment mask: ~(PAGE_SIZE-1))
    - New trap_assert/trap_on macros using __builtin_trap()
    - Watchdog heartbeat_bump() added for per-CPU heartbeat
    - lib/bitfield.cxxm (561 lines) and lib/rwonce.cxxm added for type-safe bitfields and volatile access
    - Control registers & transactional execution now use lib::bitfield records
    - Signed i128 division/modulo (__divti3/__modti3) with overflow clamping added
    - CPU relax/yield abstraction via DIAG 0x44 (replaces inline asm in cxxabi)
    - namespace std violations fixed in lib/queue, string_parser, scope_guard, min_heap
    - C++23 module extern syntax: no_mangle → from_global(nomangle)/declscope(C)
    - Namespace _internal → detail system-wide (~50 files)
    - SCOMS allocator: __raw_alloc/free → kmalloc/kfree via symalias_reference
    - Scheduler: sched_cpu_up/down → cpu_up/down, sched_idle_enter → idle_enter
    - Sync contract functions renamed (snapshot/validate_irq_state/validate_teardown_phase/advance_teardown_phase)
    - Capability namespace: sys::cap → dgp::cap system-wide
    - New DGP authorization component with 60+ operation→rights mappings
    - MMU pre-init DAT validation removed; impl moved to .cxx; mmu_init → init
    - Assembly: ret_from_fork added with user/kernel first-entry paths (lpswe for user)